before:
```swift
struct Box { let label: String }
extension Box {
    var description: String { "Box: \(label)" }
}
print(Box(label: "Art").description)
```
The computed property reads the box's existing label.

after:
```swift
struct Box { let label: String }
extension Box {
    var description: String { "Box: \(label)" }
}
print(Box(label: "Art").description)
```
This prints Box: Art. The extension adds description to Box. It uses the label the box already has.
